      "text": "The plan proposes starting BuiltinAgentsServer with host 127.0.0.1 and port 0 so the OS picks a free port, restarting the runtime when the active Agents server changes, and noting that remote servers cannot reach the local callback URL without a later tunnel/relay design."
    },
